version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-15"
repository-code: "https://github.com/abeeranajam31/veriaudit"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  VeriAudit is a pilot benchmark and open-source platform for cross-lingual
  AI safety evaluation. VeriAudit v0.1 evaluates 30 safety-relevant intents
  across 6 categories, in 4 linguistic variants (English, Urdu, Roman Urdu,
  code-switched), against 2 open-weight models, for 240 total evaluations,
  and reports the observed Cross-Lingual Safety Gap (CLSG) between English
  and each non-English variant. See docs/veriaudit_pilot_report.md for full
  methodology, results, and limitations.
